        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okujunwa kwa Yerusaalemu okw'omu biro eby'omumaiso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binu nibyo ebigambo ebyagambirwe MUKAMA, MUKAMA ayayanjurwire iguru, ayahangire ensi kandi ayahaire abantu obwomeezi, naagamba ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yerusaalemu ndigifoora kikopo ky'amarwa; amahanga agagiherraine, galinywa gataratale nk'abatamiizi. Kandi obu baligota Yerusaalemu, embuga za Yuda eziriba zisigaireho, nazo zirigotwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasumi ako obu kalihika, Yerusaalemu ndirufoora ibale erirukulemerra amahanga goona; boona abalirengaho kulihimba, balisaasa muno. Kandi amahanga goona ag'ensi, galyekoba garurwanise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagamba ati nditiinisa buli mbaraasi yoona, omutembi wayo mmunage iraro. Baitu obu ndita amaiso ha mbaraasi ez'amahanga goona ndirolerra enju ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enganda za Yuda, nubwo zirigamba ziti, ‘MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga ow'abasi ba Yerusaalemu, nuwe abaha amaani.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omu kasumi ako, enganda za Yuda ndizifoora nk'omurro ogurukwakira omu kibira, rundi omu musiri gw'engano enyakwezire; zirihwerekereza amahanga goona agaziherraine. Abantu ba Yerusaalemu, baliikara n'obusinge omu rubuga rwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obusinguzi, MUKAMA alibanza kubuha Yuda, nukwo kireke kukirwa ekya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, MUKAMA alirinda abo abaliba bali Yerusaalemu, kandi noobwakubaire abarukukirra kimu obuceke omuli bo, baliba b'amaani, nka Daudi oku akaba ali, kandi enju ya Daudi, erisisana nk'enyakwemeriirweho Ruhanga, nk'enyakwemeriirweho malaika wa MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, ndyehwamu mpwerekereze amahanga goona aganyakuseesira Yerusaalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
